 "headline": "“The day got crazier with a drumline performance down the street just outside of the convention center and a surprise performance from Sisqo!” - @jvtechtea",
 "intro": "PEACOCK TAPPED IHC AND TO CREATE A SURPRISE MARCHING BAND AND SISQO PERFORMANCE DURING SDCC TO PROMOTE THE RELEASE OF<em> TWISTED METAL</em>.",
