  {
   "title": "on stage performance",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "html": "<p>As the march crew returned to the lot, Sweet Tooth took the stage while the band and immersive talent continued to hype up the crowd. Sweet Tooth announced their panel, then introduced our surprise true star, Sisquo. As Sweet Tooth belted “Unleash the Dragon,” our cast released pink smoke for Sisqo’s grand entrance. Sweet Tooth joined his idol onstage for a joint performance of “Thong Song” to close out the day. </p>"
    },
